      "title": "D & H India Limited announced that it expects to receive INR 81.42675 million in funding",
      "body": "D & H India Limited announced a private placement of up to 2,157,000 convertible warrants at a price of INR 37.75 per warrant for gross proceeds of up to INR 81,426,750 on March 14, 2026. Each warrant convertible into 21,57,000 equity shares of INR10/- at premium in one or more tranches within a period of 18 months from the date of allotment of warrants on preferential basis to promoters and promoter group of the company. The transaction involves new investor participation of Shri Harsh Vora for 6,15,000 warrants, Shri Saurabh Vora for 7,86,000 warrants, Smt. Kiran Vora for 7,56,000 warrants. The transaction has been approved by the board of directors and subject to approval of members in their Extra Ordinary General Meeting scheduled to be held on April 10, 2026.",
